# Batch files must arrive with CRLF. cmd.exe mis-parses LF-only .bat scripts — the first token of a
# command gets eaten, so a fresh clone fails with errors like "'em' is not recognized" from a `rem`
# line. core.autocrlf=input converts on commit but not on checkout, so this has to be explicit.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# The launcher's manifest is embedded into the exe as it is on disk (launcher/BugtopiaLauncher/Bugtopia.rc),
# so its bytes ship: kept exactly as extracted from the SDK default, CRLF and BOM included.
launcher/BugtopiaLauncher/assets/app.manifest -text
